    "body": "## Summary\n- add an authenticated `Zgłoś ofertę` action to discovery/saved job cards for listings owned by another user\n- add a dedicated reporting modal using the existing private `POST /job-reports/jobs/{jobId}` contract\n- support structured reasons, optional details up to 1000 characters, duplicate/own-job error handling and a local submitted state\n- document the user-facing moderation semantics and privacy boundary\n\n## Safety / privacy\nThe client sends only the existing structured reason plus optional moderation note. It does not submit route geometry, exact location, live tracking, escrow or payment data. The UI explicitly warns against including sensitive payment information and explains that a report does not automatically remove a listing or sanction an account. Backend ownership and duplicate-report constraints remain authoritative.\n\n## Validation\nRun frontend lint/build, Maven verify and the existing runtime/security smokes. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
